14:{"name":"Café Abyss","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572116469696-31de0f17cc34?w=600&q=80","description":"A moody, candlelit cocktail bar with an extensive whisky list and jazz playing low in the background. The bartenders here are serious about their craft.","address":"32-8 Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ask for the off-menu 'Midnight Seoul' cocktail — it's their signature and it's incredible.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"}
15:{"name":"Thursday Party","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566417713940-fe7c737a9ef2?w=600&q=80","description":"The quintessential Hongdae dive bar. Cheap soju towers, loud music, and a crowd that's always up for a good time. Don't come here for quiet conversation.","address":"19-3 Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Thursday nights are obviously the busiest — go Wednesday for the same vibe with more space.","priceLevel":"₩"}
16:{"name":"Vault 82","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525268323446-0505b6fe7778?w=600&q=80","description":"A speakeasy-style bar hidden behind an unmarked door. The cocktail menu changes seasonally and the interior feels like stepping into a 1920s bank vault.","address":"82 Eoulmadang-ro, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ring the doorbell and wait — the entrance is intentionally hard to find. Look for the brass plate.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"}
