12:{"slug":"best-bars-hongdae","title":"Best Bars In Hongdae","city":"seoul","category":"nightlife","neighbourhood":"Hongdae","neighbourhoodSlug":"hongdae","priceRange":"₩₩ – ₩₩₩","nearestMetro":"Hongik University (Line 2)","openingHours":"6 PM – 3 AM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514933651103-005eec06c04b?w=1200&q=80","summary":"From craft cocktails to soju dives — the definitive Hongdae bar guide.","intro":"Hongdae's bar scene is as eclectic as the neighbourhood itself. Graffiti-walled dives sit next to sleek cocktail lounges, and on any given night the energy spills from the venues onto the streets. Here are the spots worth your time.","venues":"$13","relatedSlugs":"$17","tags":"$18","authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}
1b:{"name":"Fritz Coffee","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=600&q=80","description":"A beloved Seoul roastery with a cosy industrial interior and pastries baked fresh on-site. Their hand-drip coffee is consistently excellent.","address":"17 Dosan-daero 15-gil, Gangnam-gu","tip":"Try the einspänner — their version with house-made whipped cream is the best in Seoul.","priceLevel":"₩₩"}
1a:["$1b"]
